	affiliations = {American Community School of Abu Dhabi, Abu Dhabi, United Arab Emirates},
	abstract = {In the information era, numerous social media platforms have developed their information recommendation algorithm to deeply shape user' platform usage habits. While manifestly enhancing users' stickiness towards the platform, they also exploit "information cocoon"theory, providing users with only single-interest, single-dimension, and single-perspective content. This leads to the radicalization and divergence in social values, exacerbating the "echo chamber"effect. In this paper, we adopt Transformer to optimize the existing information recommendation mechanism, With the focus on the comprehensive weights of information, we have improved the self-attention and cross-attention mechanism, thereby significantly increasing the information entropy. We also use a loss function to greatly guarantee that such optimization can still allow expected user stickiness. Through experiement, While effectively ensuring the information accuracy, our method aims to maximize the information diversity. © 2025 IEEE.},
